      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SKETCHY BUT NOT (1) drew a middle box and finished in the money on debut at this track over 400m (23.30). Boxed the fence this time. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. ZIPPING COREY (6) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (30.49) in a Maiden at Nowra. Cannot be left out. PRINCESS DOCKER (4) settled well back early on debut and always towards the tail to finish seventh (21.25) at Grafton over 350m. Much improved and rates a winning chance. EXACERBATE (3) is another with top-three prospects.",
